+---
+id: dl-002-time-comes-from-an-injected-clock-defaulting-at-the-package-edge
+type: decision-log
+title: "Time comes from an injected clock, defaulting at the package edge"
+status: pending
+format: 1
+---
+
+## Context
+
+Tasks need timestamps, but the domain may not read the clock (r3).
+
+## Decision
+
+`createTaskList` takes a `now: () => string` function and calls it once per add and per successful change.
+`createTodoList` in `src/index.ts`, outside the domain, takes the same optional parameter and defaults to
+`new Date().toISOString()`.
+
+## Consequences
+
+- The domain stays deterministic; tests pass a fake clock.
+- `createTaskList` and `createTask` signatures changed (they take the clock / the time); only the package
+  uses them.
