+---
+id: task-002-record-createdat-and-updatedat-on-each-task
+type: task
+title: "Record createdAt and updatedAt on each task"
+status: pending
+format: 1
+---
+
+## What was done
+
+Every task now has `createdAt` and `updatedAt` (ISO-8601 date-time strings). They are equal when a task is
+added; completing, reopening, renaming, tagging or untagging sets `updatedAt` to the time of the change
+and keeps `createdAt`. A change that fails leaves the task untouched. Tests in `test/list.test.ts`.
